# Approved safe removal of Ubuntu metrics and crash-reporting components.
# Removing whoopsie-preferences would also remove GDM, GNOME Shell, Settings, and the
# Ubuntu session, so that settings integration package is retained. The whoopsie upload
# service is retained but masked. PackageKit is deliberately retained.
apport
apport-core-dump-handler
apport-gtk
apport-symptoms
ubuntu-insights
